<p class="sp-reveal sp-reveal--up">Choose the S5 for a small room. The open midrange is what we listen for, and the stated range is 10–20 m². A study of about 14 m² sits inside that span. Sensitivity is 86 dB. The pair is at its best with the A40.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"sp-reveal sp-reveal--up"} -->
<p class="sp-reveal sp-reveal--up">Choose the S8 when the room is 20–35 m² and you want full range and easy bass. Sensitivity is 90 dB. It is also at its best with the A40. The S8 ships by courier at the same rates as the rest of the range: free in the EU over €150, otherwise €9. If you want both pairs in one visit, the hour allows two speaker pairs, volume-matched, on the same tracks.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --></section>
<!-- /wp:group -->

